04:03.926 --> 04:05.255
So I to the fourth is one and

04:05.255 --> 04:06.735
then you have X to the fourth.

04:06.735 --> 04:10.350
Plus X to the fourth over four factorial.

04:10.350 --> 04:13.639
And then you're going
