04:32.985 --> 04:38.946
then negative I, then one,
then I, then negative one,

04:38.946 --> 04:42.515
X to the sixth over six factorial,

04:42.515 --> 04:48.618
and then negative IX to the seventh

04:48.618 --> 04:51.131
over seven factorial.

04:51.131 --> 04:54.114
So we have some terms,
some of them are imaginary,

04:54.114 --> 04:57.119
