04:57.119 --> 04:58.600
Some of them are real.

04:58.600 --> 05:02.983
Why don't we separate them out?

05:02.983 --> 05:04.653
So once again, E to the IX, is going to be

05:04.653 --> 05:06.694
equal to this thing, especially as we add

05:06.694 --> 05:08.125
