05:27.445 --> 05:30.210
So the real terms here are

05:30.210 --> 05:34.261
one minus X squared over two factorial

05:34.261 --> 05:37.974
plus X to the fourth over four factorial,

05:37.974 --> 05:39.909
you might be getting excited now,

05:39.909 --> 05:43.638
minus X to the sixth over six factorial

05:43.638 --> 05:45.261
and that's all I've done
here, but they would

05:45.261 --> 05:47.941
