05:47.941 --> 05:50.930
So that's all of the real terms.

05:50.930 --> 05:52.197
And what are the imaginary terms here.

05:52.197 --> 05:55.130
And I'll just factor out the I over here.

05:55.130 --> 05:56.503
Actually, let me just factor out.

05:56.503 --> 06:02.862
So it's going to be plus I times,
